      "content": "it's not just the judging tho. it's that there's nothing left. even if i tried to fix it, nobody wants to see me. i'm just... done. like, the person i was is gone and this version of me doesn't belong anywhere. it feels like there's no point in even trying to exist in a world that's already decided i don't exist.",
