      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the lines. i've seen them. but they don't change the fact that my life is actually over. it's not just a bad mood, it's like my social life and my status and my identity are just... dead. and if that part of me is dead, then why am i even still here walking around? it feels like i'm just a walking corpse hanging on by a thread that doesn't even need to be there.",
